[{"title":"得江楼","author":"洪适","text":"官事何时了，凭高思豁然。\n逐江开北户，望岫顿修椽。\n繁卉浑相亚，新篁便可怜。\n归心入春梦，已绕故山前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19288,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"花信亭","author":"洪适","text":"解报花消息，江边有好风。\n吹香四时别，问讯几人同。\n梅坞难藏白，桃蹊岂借红。\n但能长检校，定不酒尊空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19289,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小雨同裴弟深甫坚上人登新亭次韵","author":"洪适","text":"移梅种竹趁阳春，举目江山发兴新。\n曲槛疏窗那草草，飞檐碧瓦已鳞鳞。\n鼎来好语酬佳景，更有高僧话净因。\n步屧踌躇乌亦喜，不嫌风雨垫冠巾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19290,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春雪再作戏成绝句","author":"洪适","text":"常年穷腊无一白，盈尺冬来已屡书。\n底事天公太手熟，又同春絮到阶除。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19291,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题陈阜卿总秀堂","author":"洪适","text":"佳丽并包地，曼花子夜香。\n望中团野色，尘外发天光。\n小队高牙驻，轻裘清啸长。\n故应堂上燕，相与贺雕梁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19292,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"使虏道中次韵会亭","author":"洪适","text":"平野风烟阔，孤村父老存。\n薄云低故堞，落日逐輶轩。\n分裂时云久，澄清敌未吞。\n春光满花柳，天道竟何言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19293,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过谷熟","author":"洪适","text":"玉帛齐盟亦可寻，东风著面客尘侵。\n隋堤望远人烟少，汴水流乾辙迹深。\n桃李不言应感旧，山川无主祇伤今。\n遗民久厌腥膻苦，辟国谋乖负此心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19294,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵马上偶成","author":"洪适","text":"天遣祥风扫塞氛，越疆轺传礼仪新。\n禦戎可鉴秦无策，觇国谁夸郑有人。\n鸣鹤九皋闻彻响，翔龙千载仰攀鳞。\n垂鞭日日陪清话，谈笑成章泣鬼神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19295,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵车中倦吟二首 其一","author":"洪适","text":"旧国于今作两家，邻翁有酒不能赊。\n明朝又逐归鸿去，祇有尘埃满一车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19296,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵车中倦吟二首 其二","author":"洪适","text":"叱驭宁辞历险难，投戈且幸迩遐安。\n毡车轩簸长危坐，恰似舟行八节滩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19297,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵初入东京二首 其一","author":"洪适","text":"乾坤正欲稔天骄，会见降胡款圣朝。\n蓄锐乘机先自治，莫令武库五兵销。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19298,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵初入东京二首 其二","author":"洪适","text":"五门双阙未央城，碧瓦朱甍云雾生。\n真主南巡正尝胆，从今瞻仰泰阶平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19299,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过黄河用上介龙深甫迁居旧韵","author":"洪适","text":"风埃如雾满川黄，马上朝来识太行。\n水泻浊河桥甚壮，沙连远塞路何长。\n皇华复讲衣裳会，京阙今为毡罽乡。\n夹道桑麻过千亩，野花时有一枝香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19300,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"洪适","text":"宣防瓠子挠西京，向者河堤役不宁。\n胡虏任教流就下，始知谈舌误朝廷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19301,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵北使邀观常丰湖","author":"洪适","text":"一派澄湖何处来，鸣桹渔子聚还开。\n主人甚顾他乡客，莫使归途欠一杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19302,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵初望太行山","author":"洪适","text":"曾峦逾碣石，形胜镇神州。\n可惜羊肠险，今包鼠穴羞。\n天心端有待，人力岂能谋。\n未老如凭轼，壶浆为曲留。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19303,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵伊洛道中","author":"洪适","text":"万里修邻好，毡裘不乱群。\n边锋方两解，春事已平分。\n发轫鸡三唱，挥毫酒半醺。\n问途殊未已，返顾羡归云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19304,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵汤阴寒食遇雨","author":"洪适","text":"殊方遇寒食，节物负年华。\n小雨偏宜柳，轻风未落花。\n见饧如隔岭，对月共忘家。\n俗重之推庙，谁祠万里沙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19305,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵讲武城","author":"洪适","text":"汉鼎三分霸业成，并吞犹未戒佳兵。\n故城四壁存陈迹，荒冢千年断乐声。\n何必枕戈防诡计，岂容横槊窃诗名。\n我来吊古停车辙，垄上农人也辍耕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19306,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵赵州石桥","author":"洪适","text":"访古汶河上，聊忘道路劳。\n仙踪尝策蹇，海怪或镌鳌。\n济远徒杠小，凭虚乱石牢。\n何时冠盖集，一变犬羊臊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19307,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过中山","author":"洪适","text":"三关标重镇，自昔护边陲。\n观者堵墙立，纷然帘幕垂。\n欲谋千日醉，恐误十旬期。\n可喜中庭月，何妨尽一卮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19308,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过保州","author":"洪适","text":"艺祖枌榆社，唐人保塞军。\n百年邻毳幕，今日聚妖氛。\n故老垂黄发，妍姬艳綵裙。\n白沟才一舍，何计可中分。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19309,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵早行","author":"洪适","text":"夙驾星光动，徐行雾气迷。\n塞鸿翻月去，胡马向风嘶。\n柝静谯门晓，轮攲沙路低。\n颇思眠蕙帐，枕上听邻鸡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19310,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵得保州老张瓦研","author":"洪适","text":"毛颖传既成，陶泓名不朽。\n陈楮接武来，论交篇籍囿。\n千年铜雀台，瓦解沦坤厚。\n何人澄其泥，颇能髣髴否。\n龙公天上客，金兰幸同臭。\n结束万里行，联翩五旬久。\n清谈落玉麈，痛饮尽金斗。\n咳唾珠玑粲，挥翰不停手。\n穷边得佳研，可出老吕右。\n瓦缶莫雷鸣，龙尾羞牛后。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19311,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵保州闻角 其一","author":"洪适","text":"觉来屈指数修程，历遍中原长短亭。\n谁向城头晓鸣角，胡音嘈囋不须听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19312,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵保州闻角 其二","author":"洪适","text":"胡音嘈囋不须听，整顿征衫待启明。\n已把哀笳变清角，可伤任昧杂韶英。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19313,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵梁门","author":"洪适","text":"双垒依然柳作阴，故疆行尽倍伤心。\n时平且得无争战，苔上戈枪卧绿沈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19314,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵白沟河","author":"洪适","text":"唐馀画壤愧鸿沟，西闭关门汉道柔。\n一自旄头入京洛，至今泉水不东流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19315,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵回程至涿鹿","author":"洪适","text":"回首燕然日再西，一杯相属使轺归。\n残花媚野不妨好，倦鸟投林自在飞。\n可惜光阴销客枕，不嫌尘土染征衣。\n大明退直清和日，已约梯云访翠微。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19316,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"燕馆日膳得四雁笼之以归","author":"洪适","text":"提携乘雁脱庖丁，等待他年羽翼成。\n唳月摩云须有便，莫教更作不能鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19317,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵杨花二首 其一","author":"洪适","text":"桃花开落不同时，燕子衔泥相伴飞。\n若向章台问春色，可无清泪湿征衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19318,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵杨花二首 其二","author":"洪适","text":"官路风轻落絮迷，望中高下杂游丝。\n糁毡拟雪春无际，只有骚人圣得知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19319,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再至保州","author":"洪适","text":"再入中原境，相迎有暮鸦。\n柔桑新迸叶，高柳细吹花。\n短帻人如秃，尖冠女不髽。\n指期淮可渡，宁叹在天涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19320,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵再至中山","author":"洪适","text":"路指中山国，人归析木津。\n终风震檐瓦，细雨压车尘。\n落纸诗章速，开尊酒力醇。\n无功惭报国，来往谩劳人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19321,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵中山雨后","author":"洪适","text":"好雨连宵鸠唤晴，晓行襟袂有馀清。\n远游朔塞殊风景，梦到东阡看火耕。\n红退桃蹊三月晚，绿添麦垄一川平。\n纤尘不逐车轮起，喜听驱驴叱马声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19322,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵村店得牡丹","author":"洪适","text":"花品称王擅洛京，朱朱白白莫齐名。\n相逢河朔春将暮，半吐檀心若有情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19323,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵陈留闻莺","author":"洪适","text":"恰恰啼莺马上听，凝云欲雨晓寒轻。\n满郊碧草皆春色，祇欠山光与水声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19324,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵宁陵憩驿","author":"洪适","text":"野外人声寂，林间鸟羽翻。\n朱樱喜堆案，青杏助开尊。\n故国多荒草，遗黎有怨言。\n雨馀尘土静，不复污归轩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19325,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵南京道中","author":"洪适","text":"密叶成阴行路宽，鸠鸣莺啭足开颜。\n半涂泥滑夜来雨，数片云飞何处山。\n薄暮每寻樽俎共，残春能伴节旄还。\n尘襟好濯西湖水，偷取禅房一日闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19326,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵游臞庵不果","author":"洪适","text":"水纹如縠送归船，渐近觚棱尺五天。\n适意莼鲈公有兴，寻盟鸥鸟我无缘。\n远怀并辔穿红皱，近阻携筇款碧鲜。\n却待湖山最高处，醉中一笑挹臞仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19327,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄别景卢","author":"洪适","text":"禹穴遗书不可寻，坐看绿叶再成林。\n千岩竞秀非吾土，三径就荒劳我心。\n谁是周人思召伯，今无老叟出山阴。\n台阶稳上添花萼，时倩来鸿续好音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19328,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蓝宪遣人往吴门移洛花未至而去 其一","author":"洪适","text":"雒京隔绝花难得，茂苑移将信已通。\n世事好乖犹献鹄，雕栏不用怨东风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19329,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蓝宪遣人往吴门移洛花未至而去 其二","author":"洪适","text":"新坛巧斲列东西，准拟看花倒接篱。\n交臂失之端可笑，傥来外物尽难期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19330,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蓝宪遣人往吴门移洛花未至而去 其三","author":"洪适","text":"三春桃李家家有，不费阳和特地恩。\n名品异芳天亦靳，未教容易到丘园。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19331,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登芝榭见景卢所增月台","author":"洪适","text":"台榭相望闻语声，茹芝观月有馀清。\n旁连小隐分三径，细数修篁限一城。\n日日杖头思径醉，年年铛脚玩欣荣。\n谁人知我归欤乐，趁此登临未惮行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19332,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"许倩报白榴已得玉茗未谐以诗趣之","author":"洪适","text":"万里移根安石国，何年傅粉未知名。\n须邀玉茗来岩壑，便结琼花作弟兄。\n诗客定疑天外得，园人已办腊前迎。\n东家阿措休相妒，不学秾妆照眼明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19333,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵景卢喜得安州牡丹","author":"洪适","text":"洛中花信已沉声，泾渭宁分浊与清。\n近出黟山空接壤，远来安陆比连城。\n虚坛仅免游人问，浪蕊从教著处荣。\n更欲丁宁新芍药，莫誇多少便横行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19334,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵景卢野处解嘲之什","author":"洪适","text":"地偏不接市廛声，古木参天鹤唳清。\n台榭迥穷千里目，诗章突过五言城。\n花移琼树真无敌，酒换金貂未足荣。\n灯火归时笙管作，解嘲何事有歌行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19335,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再赋","author":"洪适","text":"幽壑藏云水作声，纫兰入室好风清。\n高蜚便有缥缥意，进筑如开荡荡城。\n百尺楼成同日涉，四时花发匪朝荣。\n园池如许谁言小，但放刍荛雉兔行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19336,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬景卢赋圃中种橘移花","author":"洪适","text":"瓮头玉友已销声，小试山斋百末清。\n十客对花休避席，千奴呼橘拟专城。\n微霜到处叶未落，小雨移来根易荣。\n情话团栾亦终日，坐中惟欠十般行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19337,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬景卢谢菊","author":"洪适","text":"涉秋无复滴阶声，夜雨随风尘已清。\n平日爱山营一壑，老来学圃列三城。\n园夫种树元无术，篱菊分丛独晚荣。\n蹑屐问花兼问柳，不须乘毳可泥行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19338,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答景卢","author":"洪适","text":"雁翅齐飞有隽声，文章何止赋华清。\n谁教短策长寻壑，不拥高牙且典城。\n台省向来非独冷，身名此日已俱荣。\n盈旬诗轴牛腰大，抱牍须同饕虱行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19339,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病酒","author":"洪适","text":"三日惟闻煮药声，一中可怕圣之清。\n移花种竹已得地，逢酒当歌须闭城。\n远避霜风严北户，静看朝日满东荣。\n双螯退步输年少，谁与抽琴作蟹行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19340,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答景严","author":"洪适","text":"向来戎马沸边声，曾出良筹助扫清。\n六载倦游潜楚泽，一枝同折记栾城。\n北门西府仍班缀，后雁前鸿愧宠荣。\n两鬓星星吾老矣，看君重上赤墀行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19341,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"景严送冬杏","author":"洪适","text":"苍头呼梦杂鸡声，蕊杏诗来句转清。\n独傲风霜爱冬日，不随桃李媚花城。\n一枝得得能相对，凡卉纷纷孰并荣。\n大队开时春且尽，醉吟当续丽人行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19342,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"景卢送瑞香","author":"洪适","text":"翠幄藏春巧寄声，熏笼织锦晓天清。\n幽香端是花中瑞，仙派初来尘外城。\n酒海何妨三雅进，鬓云谁称一枝荣。\n雨来顿使邻墙远，不到阑干深处行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19343,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"野处有诗羡山居小隐之广而有拓地不可之叹","author":"洪适","text":"败叶翻风策策声，山根可掬石泉清。\n东邻美荈久成坞，北陌新柑小筑城。\n台在家边来更好，地连郭外得非荣。\n曾楼纵目无穷景，安用垂涎杖屦行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19344,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再赋","author":"洪适","text":"厌听朱弦裂帛声，携锄斸壑赋临清。\n赏心尽得难并景，舒足休嫌踏破城。\n夜璧朝琼宁独乐，春兰秋菊岂争荣。\n闭关不使高轩过，只许渔樵为辅行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19345,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆城东来禽","author":"洪适","text":"远送来禽我独无，后来才得两三株。\n隐园野处花难比，祇恐人评棣萼图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19346,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆古城柿","author":"洪适","text":"果园幽僻少能知，丹柿乌椑手自移。\n欲学郑虔书坠叶，何人解有寄来时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19347,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆隆庭竹","author":"洪适","text":"闻道隆庭竹满园，许分苍翠长儿孙。\n看看冬尽无消息，始信壮周是寓言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19348,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆吴中洛花","author":"洪适","text":"书邮浸失鳞鸿约，栏槛长教蜂蝶猜。\n待拟子虚乌有赋，东宾仍遣耳孙来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19349,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏孙陈二弟 其一","author":"洪适","text":"城东卜筑有期无，须为檐楹动百株。\n可忍非时归爨下，合尖何似助浮图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19350,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏孙陈二弟 其二","author":"洪适","text":"古城栽种畏人知，定是根盘不可移。\n车载斗量稗贩走，果纲却有入州时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19351,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏孙陈二弟 其三","author":"洪适","text":"傍巘经营杂果园，翻愁它日逐王孙。\n不如种竹招风月，此意难逢俗子言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19352,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏孙陈二弟 其四","author":"洪适","text":"林居草创名花少，柳径苔生过客猜。\n不管空言无实惠，只嫌巧取近嗟来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19353,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再赋 其一","author":"洪适","text":"外求它壤曾攀桂，近舍家园尚守株。\n待得枝头如赤柰，却来看我百花图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19354,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再赋 其二","author":"洪适","text":"圃在前村若个知，山逢愚叟会须移。\n前言戏耳君休怪，七绝成阴自有时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19355,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再赋 其三","author":"洪适","text":"何人种柳成门巷，几处看花到子孙。\n且尽山斋一杯酒，此君相对已忘言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19356,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再赋 其四","author":"洪适","text":"长惭无地起楼台，觅果寻花颇受猜。\n且向园林聊寓意，不教丝管逐人来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19357,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送景卢","author":"洪适","text":"涉世难防犬吠声，放怀安可俟河清。\n昂霄莫辨千寻木，凿牖聊看三里城。\n丹橘黄甘随处好，美花香草逐时荣。\n晚来寒雨催归骑，酷似邹人接淅行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":19358,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]